# This repository moved from a Windows machine to a Mac, and the Windows copy
# rewrote nearly every tracked file with CRLF endings. That produced a diff of
# 17,000 changed lines in which only three files had changed at all, which is
# the kind of noise that makes `git log -p` and `git blame` useless for a
# project whose whole claim rests on an audit trail.
#
# Normalize to LF in the repository, whatever the working machine does.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never normalized.
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.parquet binary
